<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CDC issues fresh cautionary pending news.</title>
<headline>CDC issues fresh cautionary pending news.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Diamond Corp Ltd issued a further cautionary on Tuesday, urging shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings pending an announcement.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief statement. It first cautioned shareholders on January 21.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
